{
    "background_story": "Rosie was a quirky and stylish woman who owned a small vintage boutique in the city. She had a passion for collecting unique and exotic handbags, and her store was a treasure trove of one-of-a-kind purses. Rosie's favorite pastime was scouring thrift stores and estate sales for rare and hidden gems to add to her collection. Her prized possession was a 1950s Chanel purse that she had found at a garage sale for a steal. Rosie loved nothing more than to match her customers with the perfect purse to suit their personality and style. Her boutique became a beloved institution in the community, and people came from all over to see Rosie's incredible collection and bask in her infectious enthusiasm for all things purse-related.",
